<title>CANADA: TABLE - Shell Canada Q2 shr profit climbs.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Shell Canada Q2 shr profit climbs.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			  1996</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.33		   C$0.24</p>
<p> Net			111,000		   82,000</p>
<p> Revs		   1,288,000		1,248,000</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.78		   C$0.53</p>
<p> Net			263,000		  180,000</p>
<p>Cash flow/shr  Revs		   2,639,000		2,428,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 336,000		  337,000</p>
<p>		  (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Shell Canada Ltd's 1996 revenues were restated to reflect the company's chemical business which was sold on December 31, 1996. Second-quarter 1996 earnings restated were C$70 million and first-half 1996 earnings restated were C$156 million.</p>
<p>Earnings per share and average shares outstanding have been restated to reflect a three-for-one stock split in June 1997. ((Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
